          <div class="book-heading">
            <h2 id="book-title">Book Quant Interviews</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="book-copy">
            <p class="book-kicker">
              I wrote an AI-native book — with a human firmly in the loop.
            </p>
            <p class="book-stats">1,600 pages, 192 questions.</p>
            <div class="book-cta">
              <a
