                class="book-link"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener"
              >
                Explore Quant Interviews <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
              </a>
            </div>
            <p>
              From Mathematical Foundations to Production-Grade Quant Systems —
              an implementation edition spanning over 1,600 pages, with worked
              examples, production-minded code, mathematical derivations,
              interview questions, and end-to-end system design.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="book-volume-grid" aria-label="Quant Interviews volumes">
          <article class="book-volume-card">
